<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <NeutralLanguage>en-US</NeutralLanguage>
    <PackageId>Cynicszm.FlatFiles</PackageId>
    <Authors>Cynicszm</Authors>
    <Description>Reads and writes CSV, fixed-length and other flat file formats with a focus on schema definition, configuration and speed. Supports mapping directly between files and classes. A fork of FlatFiles by Travis Parks, continued for .NET 10; the assembly and namespaces are unchanged, so only the package reference differs.</Description>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/Cynicszm/FlatFiles</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/Cynicszm/FlatFiles.git</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageTags>csv;comma;tab;separated;value;delimited;flat;file;fixed;width;fixed-width;length;fixed-length;parser;parsing;parse</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>Every asynchronous read and write now has an overload taking a CancellationToken, threaded through to the underlying TextReader and TextWriter: ReadAsync, SkipAsync and GetSchemaAsync on the readers, WriteAsync, WriteSchemaAsync and WriteRawAsync on the writers, the typed readers and writers, ReadAllAsync and WriteAllAsync, and the type mappers' ReadAsync and WriteAsync. The overloads without a token are unchanged. The interfaces gain the overloads as default members, so an existing implementation keeps compiling. Source-compatible with 7.1.0.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <SignAssembly>true</SignAssembly>
    <AssemblyOriginatorKeyFile>FlatFiles.snk</AssemblyOriginatorKeyFile>
    <Version>7.2.0</Version>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup>
    <AssemblyVersion>7.2.0.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>7.2.0.0</FileVersion>
    <PackageLicenseFile>UNLICENSE.txt</PackageLicenseFile>
    <PackageIcon>icon.png</PackageIcon>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Update="Properties\Resources.Designer.cs">
      <DesignTime>True</DesignTime>
      <AutoGen>True</AutoGen>
      <DependentUpon>Resources.resx</DependentUpon>
    </Compile>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <EmbeddedResource Update="Properties\Resources.resx">
      <Generator>ResXFileCodeGenerator</Generator>
      <LastGenOutput>Resources.Designer.cs</LastGenOutput>
    </EmbeddedResource>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\icon.png">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath></PackagePath>
    </None>
    <None Include="..\UNLICENSE.txt">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath></PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
